    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="11" relname="span">The target audience wants to access this information as quickly as possible</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="1" relname="evaluation">- I couldn't agree with this more.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="13" relname="span">Technology today has become has an important part of our lives</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="3" relname="evidence">and it is plain for all to see.</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="14" relname="antithesis">We have all seen the fancy graphics and multimedia by now,</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="14" relname="span">we just want our information,</segment>
        <segment id="7" parent="6" relname="elaboration">and we want it quick.</segment>
        <segment id="8" parent="9" relname="volitional-cause">It is a fast-paced world</segment>
        <segment id="9" parent="16" relname="span">and immediate access to data is critical to customer satisfaction.</segment>
        <group id="10" type="span"/>
        <group id="11" type="span" parent="10" relname="span"/>
